From 4816673cec1df88714c2dfbbb32b567d36897f98 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ginux-watch-agent <actions@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 10:40:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] tests(core): pin open/openat read-only admission

### What
Pins open(2)/openat(257) admission to read-only: any write access mode or mutating flag is denied.

### Why it matters
The balanced surface is read-only for opens; widening it would admit writes. Existing tests pin writev/wait4 but not open flags.

### Mutation evidence (fail-then-pass)
| Mutant | Existing suite | New test |
|---|---|---|
| drop O_ACCMODE from open mask | PASS (survives) | FAIL (killed) |
| openat mask -> 0 | PASS (survives) | FAIL (killed) |

Baseline: PASS. Reproduce: `cargo test -p ginux-core --lib open_admission_is_readonly`.

Prepared with AI assistance; reviewed by me.
---
 crates/ginux-core/src/lib.rs | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/crates/ginux-core/src/lib.rs b/crates/ginux-core/src/lib.rs
index 65dbf923..899d4c70 100644
--- a/crates/ginux-core/src/lib.rs
+++ b/crates/ginux-core/src/lib.rs
@@ -1025,4 +1025,14 @@ mod tests {
         assert!(balanced_arguments_allowed(SYS_WAIT4, u64::MAX, 0, 0));
         assert!(balanced_arguments_allowed(SYS_WAIT4, 1, 0, 0));
     }
+
+    #[test]
+    fn open_admission_is_readonly() {
+        assert!(balanced_arguments_allowed(2, 0, 0, 0));
+        assert!(!balanced_arguments_allowed(2, 0, 1, 0));
+        assert!(!balanced_arguments_allowed(2, 0, 2, 0));
+        assert!(!balanced_arguments_allowed(2, 0, 0o100, 0));
+        assert!(balanced_arguments_allowed(257, 0, 0, 0));
+        assert!(!balanced_arguments_allowed(257, 0, 1, 0));
+    }
 }
